    "text": "By Faith Graham Rubén Rosario ,\n18 hours ago MIAMI (WSVN) - A scare at a school in Miami landed a man accused of bringing a firearm behind bars. City of Miami Police on Wednesday said they arrested 22-year-old Anthony Mariano Gutierrez for bringing a gun onto school property at the Citrus Grove K-8 Center, located at 2153 NW 3rd St., Tuesday afternoon. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 3",
